abstract: >-
  A research-oriented lifelong-learning system with one shared mentalization core.
  Its world tree separates objective roots, an Agent Bridge trunk and subjective
  experience branches. A dynamic golden-bias regulator separates observation windows from evidence-gated rhythm periodicity. The v2.0 dual-chain backend adds isolated self-models, observer-owned peer hypotheses, revocable shared views, participant-approved shared branches and group models that never read private member state. The v2.1 product thesis connects the self loop to action in the world, relational mentalizing, and group outcomes.